  "description": "FUZZAD crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C90 H115 Eu5 N10 O45 P10. From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu3 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu4 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu5 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.672-5.242 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 87.91-160.45°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula Eu5L6(μ-L)4(μ3-OH)4(μ4-OH) (C90H115Eu5N10O45P10; L− = [C6H5C(O)NP(O)(OCH3)2]−). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 1 μ4-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula). Article name explicitly identifies I(II).",
